Error [jet.LoopResultMismatch]: This loop break needs a value
  --> tests/ui/result_loop_break_payloads.jet:3:19
    |
  3 |         if true { break }
    |                   ^^^^^
 Why: An ordinary loop used as a value needs a payload on every matching break
 Fix: Write `break value`
