Error [jet.LoopResultMismatch]: This loop breaks with `String`, but another exit uses `Int`
  --> tests/ui/result_loop_break_payloads.jet:14:15
    |
 14 |         break "other"
    |               ^^^^^^^
 Why: An ordinary loop used as a value has one result type
 Fix: Make every break payload use the same type
